  "status": "present",
  "value": "routes lists strings \"<source>:<target>:<method>:<cost>\" (country codes of 2 or 3 capital letters, source != target, method letters, positive integer cost), each a directed route; no two routes share source, target and method. Level 2 (source != target): return every path from source to target using one route, or two routes through an intermediate country other than source and target, as [path, totalCost] where path is \"<source>:<method>:<target>\" or \"<source>:<method1>:<middle>:<method2>:<target>\"; order by total cost and then path (code point).",
